[I] C library for generating audio fingerprints used by AcoustID

[T] Chromaprint is a C library for generating compact audio fingerprints,
[T] developed for the AcoustID project. It targets identification of full
[T] audio files, duplicate detection and stream monitoring, and also ships
[T] the fpcalc utility used e.g. by MusicBrainz Picard.

[U] https://acoustid.org/chromaprint

[A] Chromaprint Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS

[V] 1.6.2
[P] X -----5---9 152.650
